{#
  Page-builder homepage. Renders the ordered `blocks` from homepage.json, one partial per
  block `type` (see _includes/blocks/). Editors add, reorder and edit these in the CMS,
  which also renders a live preview by running these same partials — which is why each one
  reads only `sec` and imports nothing. See _includes/blocks/README.md.

  `ignore missing` matters: a block type with no partial is content the CMS can write but
  this build does not know about, and that must not fail the whole build.
#}
